<mj-section>
<mj-column>
<mj-text><p>Every December we read a year of bounces, complaints and inbox placement, and write down what changed.</p><p>The short version: authentication stopped being optional.</p></mj-text>
<mj-raw rc-preview="end"><!-- rc:preview-end --></mj-raw>
<mj-text><h3>What changed</h3><p>Gmail and Yahoo now refuse unauthenticated bulk mail outright.</p><p>View on X: <a href="https://twitter.com/acme/status/1730000000000000000">https://twitter.com/acme/status/1730000000000000000</a></p><p>The full numbers are below.</p></mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
</mj-body>
